  "Faktor hambatan_dinyatakan_pelanggan unknown; tidak diberi poin dan bukan bukti negatif.": "Customer-stated blocker is unknown; no points assigned, not negative evidence.",
  "Faktor unknown = 0 poin dan dicatat; limitations menyebut rank yang dapat berubah bila unknown terisi.": "Unknown factors receive 0 points and are recorded; limitations identify rankings that could change if the information becomes available.",
  "Gate tetap berlaku terlepas dari rank: VP Sales (E01): putuskan dan catat di decision_log permintaan diskon 20% (I0348, 2026-09-28); >10% wajib approval. Belum ada keputusan sah yang tercatat untuk DL-002.": "The requirement applies regardless of rank: VP Sales (E01) must decide and record the 20% discount request (I0348, 2026-09-28) in decision_log; discounts >10% require approval. No valid decision is recorded for DL-002.",
  "Gate wajib sebelum tindakan; tidak menaikkan/menurunkan skor dan tidak dihapus oleh nilai atau preseden.": "Required before acting; does not increase or decrease the score and is not removed by value or precedents.",
  "Hambatan dinyatakan pelanggan dideteksi dengan aturan leksikal pada isi pesan; parafrase dapat terlewat.": "Customer-stated blockers are detected using lexical rules on message content; paraphrases may be missed.",
