  "D-2024-02 (2024-04-03, diskon, akun C15): 20% -> Ditolak oleh E01; alasan: Di luar kebijakan; ditawarkan 10%": "D-2024-02 (2024-04-03, discount, account C15): 20% -> Rejected by E01; reason: Outside policy; 10% offered",
  "D-2025-02 (2025-03-04, diskon, akun C23): 20% -> Ditolak oleh E01; alasan: Di atas batas 15%; menyamai harga kompetitor merusak harga pasar. Deal kemudian kalah karena harga.": "D-2025-02 (2025-03-04, discount, account C23): 20% -> Rejected by E01; reason: Above the 15% limit; matching competitor prices harms market pricing. The deal was later lost on price.",
  "D-2025-06 (2025-08-12, pengecualian, akun C23): Paket Starter tanpa diskon, pilot 6 outlet -> Disetujui oleh E01; alasan: Pendekatan alternatif setelah kalah Maret: mulai dari Starter, naik paket bila puas. Deal menang Sep 2025.": "D-2025-06 (2025-08-12, exception, account C23): Starter plan without a discount, 6-outlet pilot -> Approved by E01; reason: An alternative after the March loss: start on Starter and upgrade if satisfied. The deal was won in Sep 2025.",
