  "DL-003 Klinik Pratama Medika: stage Discovery sejak 2026-09-21 (10 hari per 2026-10-01); nilai potensi tahunan Rp37.800.000 (bukan pendapatan).": "DL-003 Klinik Pratama Medika: Discovery stage since 2026-09-21 (10 days as of 2026-10-01); potential annual value Rp37.800.000 (not revenue).",
