  "DL-005 PT Distribusi Sumber Rejeki: stage Lead sejak 2026-09-26 (5 hari per 2026-10-01); nilai potensi tahunan Rp168.000.000 (bukan pendapatan).": "DL-005 PT Distribusi Sumber Rejeki: Lead stage since 2026-09-26 (5 days as of 2026-10-01); potential annual value Rp168.000.000 (not revenue).",
  "Deal preseden DL-006 juga mencatat kompetitor KasirPro (crm_deals.kompetitor).": "Precedent deal DL-006 also records competitor KasirPro (crm_deals.kompetitor).",
