  "Di candidate_decisions konteks ini ada 6 keputusan diskon >10%: 1 disetujui (D-2025-11), 5 ditolak (D-2024-02, D-2024-06, D-2025-02, D-2025-12, D-2026-04).": "This context's candidate_decisions contain 6 decisions on discounts >10%: 1 approved (D-2025-11), 5 rejected (D-2024-02, D-2024-06, D-2025-02, D-2025-12, D-2026-04).",
