  "I0296 (2026-08-17, P02): \"Pak Teddy suka produknya tetapi menilai harga terlalu tinggi. KasirPro menawarkan harga sekitar 20% lebih murah.\"": "I0296 (2026-08-17, P02), translated: \"Mr Teddy likes the product but considers the price too high. KasirPro offers a price around 20% lower.\"",
