  "I0334 (2026-09-21, P03): \"Butuh modul apotek untuk 9 klinik. Bu Ratna minta referensi pelanggan apotek yang sudah memakai KasirNusa.\"": "I0334 (2026-09-21, P03), translated: \"A pharmacy module is needed for 9 clinics. Ms Ratna requests a reference from a pharmacy customer already using KasirNusa.\"",
  "I0335 (2026-09-22, P04): \"Pak Bagus, Direktur Utama kami minta rekomendasi dari pengguna yang mirip dengan kami sebelum tanda tangan. Kami tunda dulu sampai ada referensi.\"": "I0335 (2026-09-22, P04), translated: \"Mr Bagus, our President Director wants a recommendation from a similar user before signing. We are putting this on hold until there is a reference.\"",
